Papinian NER
Copyright 2026 Legal Machines

Papinian NER is the protection model Singularity downloads for Papinian Guard.
Its model is the GLiNER2 privacy model that Fastino AI publishes as
fastino/gliner2-privacy-filter-PII-multi
(https://huggingface.co/fastino/gliner2-privacy-filter-PII-multi), licensed by
its publisher under the Apache License, Version 2.0. A copy of that license is
in the LICENSE file beside this notice.

Changes made by Legal Machines: the published model was converted to ONNX in
half precision (fp16), as the eight ONNX graphs and the tokenizer that
Singularity loads. It was not trained further.

It runs on the native gliner2-rs runtime, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (licenses/gliner2-rs). Its encoder derives from mDeBERTa-v3-base,
published by Microsoft under the MIT License:

